# Lucent reads its deployment from lib/deployment.json, which `pnpm
# deploy:contracts` writes automatically — so after a redeploy you just rebuild
# the app, no manual id edits. These two env vars only exist to override the
# PayrollVault / PrivateEscrow-factory ids ahead of a redeploy (e.g. pointing at
# someone else's deployment). Copy this file to .env.local to use them.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PAYROLL_ID=C...
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ESCROW_FACTORY_ID=C...

# Optional Goldsky indexer (see packages/indexer/). When set, the app backfills
# events older than the RPC's ~7-day window from the indexer; unset, it runs
# RPC-only. Copy to .env.local and point at a deployed Worker.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_INDEXER_URL=https://confidential-token-indexer.<account>.workers.dev
